      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Watertown%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The first postmaster also ran the town’s first store, opening it in 1828, marking the start of local commerce.",
